'''Gasbags''' are a unique enemy type found only in {{S|Corpse}}. While they are alive, they emit a ring of toxic gas that deals damage to Isaac if he stands in it for too long. Additionally, Gasbags will occasionally spawn a chain of 4 {{E|Army Fly|text=Army Flies}} to chase Isaac. Gasbags will only spawn flies if there are less than 8 army flies in the room, no matter how many Gasbags there are. The Gasbag's toxic cloud disappears a short time after it dies.

== Trivia ==
* The [[Anti:Gasbag|Gasbag]] first appeared in the ''Antibirth'' mod where it acted identical but could not spawn flies.

